%%{init: {'theme': 'default', 'themeVariables': { 'fontFamily': 'Inter' }}}%%
flowchart TD
    A[Client Input / Heartbeat] --> B{PresenceManager}
    B -->|Heartbeat Received| C[Update PresenceRecord Status]
    B -->|Timeout Detected| D[Exponential Backoff Recovery Scheduler]
    D -->|Calculate Delay| E[Schedule Retry Timer + Jitter]
    E -->|Timer Expires| F[Attempt Reconnection]
    F -->|Success| G[Reset Backoff State & Broadcast Online]
    F -->|Fail| D
    
    H[Message Payload Arrives] --> I{MessageRoutingEngine}
    I --> J[Priority-Ordered Fan-Out Router]
    J --> K[Validate Session & Integrity Hash]
    K --> L[Resolve Recipients via PresenceMap]
    L --> M[Insert into Priority Queue O(log M)]
    M --> N[Drain Queue & Fan-Out to Targets O(N)]
    N --> O[Push Encrypted Payload via WebSocket]
    
    P[Recipient Receives Message] --> Q{SessionContextManager}
    Q --> R[Memory-Bounded Circular Buffer Manager]
    R --> S[Check Memory Usage vs 200MB Limit]
    S -->|Within Limit| T[Append Chunk O(1) via Head/Tail Pointers]
    S -->|Exceeds Limit| U[Trigger Cleanup / Block Append]
    T --> V[Mark is_locally_deleted if requested]
    V --> W[Return BufferSnapshot + MemoryUsageReport]
    
    G --> X[System Stable State]
    O --> X
    W --> X
    
    style D fill:#f9f,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px
    style J fill:#bbf,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px
    style R fill:#bfb,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px
    style X fill:#eee,stroke:#333,stroke-width:1px